public/ is deliberately unlicensed

No license is asserted over public/, and the omission is intentional rather than
an oversight. It contains no original work by the repository owner:

  public/fonts/            Third-party typefaces under the SIL Open Font
                           License 1.1. See public/fonts/OFL.txt.
  public/icons/            Third-party platform brand marks.
  public/favicon.svg       The Astro starter template default.
  public/ethical-hacking.png   Third-party image.
  public/_headers          Deployment configuration.
  public/robots.txt        Deployment configuration.

The third-party files remain under their own terms. The two configuration files
contain no meaningfully copyrightable content, so no license is claimed over
them.
